All read-only corrections, each cross-checked against the code:
  * README listed AS/CR/SE/LC/OC as Planned although all nine trials are
    registered in incha.lua:25-33 with 25 boss modules behind them.
  * README's tree listed trial/<id>/Dispatcher.lua, which no longer exists;
    routing lives in each boss module's combatRoutes/effectRoutes.
  * README said the manifest requires the lowercase folder name; it is
    ESO's own ADDON_NAME derivation, not the manifest.
  * ROADMAP described the panel as info1–3; it renders 10 lines.
  * ROADMAP still said zoneId = TBD for CR/LC/OC (1051/1478/1548, per
    incha.lua and test/run_log.lua) and marked the sections Planned.
  * test/README misnamed three zones: 1000 is Asylum Sanctorium, 1051 is
    Cloudrest, 1548 is Ossein Cage (the code modules are OlmsEncounter,
    ZmajaEncounter and OsseinCageCommon).

Evidence, exact line numbers and the reproduction command are in .review/code-review-2026-09-01.md (see finding F-16, F-17).
Verification: static analysis only - not run in-game.
